# Generated client code lives here. Do not edit by hand.
#
# Regenerate via:
#
#   make generate
#
# This requires Node.js (`npx`) and a JRE on PATH so the
# `openapi-generator-cli` JAR can run. The wrapper layer in
# `lib/smplkit/*.rb` (everything outside this directory) is hand-crafted
# and routes every CRUD/management call through the generated
# `SmplkitGeneratedClient::App / ::Config / ::Flags / ::Logging` modules
# at runtime — see `ManagementClient` for the wiring.
